WEBVTT

00:03:29.958 --> 00:03:32.925
or even causing your condition.

00:03:32.925 --> 00:03:34.728
In addition to physical symptoms,

00:03:34.728 --> 00:03:37.113
sickness can also make you irritable,

00:03:37.113 --> 00:03:37.823
sad,

00:03:37.823 --> 00:03:39.233
and confused.

00:03:39.233 --> 00:03:41.298
That's because cytokines and prostaglandin


00:03:41.298 --> 00:03:44.385
can reach even higher structures 
in your brain,

00:03:44.385 --> 00:03:46.958
disrupting the activity 
of neurotransmitters,

00:03:46.958 --> 00:03:47.931
like glutamate,

00:03:47.931 --> 00:03:49.053
endorphins,

00:03:49.053 --> 00:03:50.238
serotonin,

00:03:50.238 --> 00:03:52.171
and dopamine.

00:03:52.171 --> 00:03:56.256
This affects areas like the limbic system,
which oversees emotions,

00:03:56.256 --> 00:04:00.702
and your cerebral cortex,
which is involved in reasoning.